.amx-about-hero h1{max-width:10ch}}\n</style>\n<section class=\"amx-about-hero\">\n<div class=\"amx-about-hero__copy\"><small data-amoura-reveal>{% if request.locale.iso_code == 'en' %}About Amoura{% else %}O Amoura{% endif %}</small><h1 data-amoura-reveal>{% if request.locale.iso_code == 'en' %}Intimacy deserves better design, language and standards.{% else %}Intymność zasługuje na lepszy design, język i standardy.{% endif %}</h1><p data-amoura-reveal>{% if request.locale.iso_code == 'en' %}Amoura brings together considered products, useful knowledge and a calmer way to choose — without turning intimacy into a loud category.{% else %}Amoura łączy dobrze wybrane produkty, użyteczną wiedzę i spokojniejszy sposób wyboru — bez zamieniania intymności w głośną kategorię.{% endif %}</p></div>\n<div class=\"amx-about-hero__object\" data-amoura-mask><div class=\"amx-about-hero__plane amx-about-hero__plane--a\" data-amoura-parallax></div><div class=\"amx-about-hero__plane amx-about-hero__plane--b\"></div><div class=\"amx-about-hero__plane amx-about-hero__plane--c\"></div></div>\n</section>",
